+- `date`: ISO date (`YYYY-MM-DD`).
+- `amount`: up to two decimals, e.g. `-45.10`.
+- `currency`: optional ISO 4217 code, exactly three uppercase ASCII
+  letters (e.g. `EUR`). When the fourth column is missing, the currency
+  is `USD`. Lowercase, other lengths, digits, an empty field or any
